    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Coig is one of Atlantic Canada's most exciting traditional Celtic groups made up of accomplished multi-instrumentalists. With a fiery Celtic high-energy style as its musical core, Coig easily shifts between century-old tunes of past generations to original and upbeat compositions featuring the band's range of over a dozen instruments (vocals, fiddles, piano, guitars, banjo, mandolin, ... n"
